{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-05 13:00:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (GNRC) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (“GENERAC” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: GNRC) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS."}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-05 10:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (GNRC) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (“GENERAC” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: GNRC) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS."}